st":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121835","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121835","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121835.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121835.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-30T16:13:59Z"},"body":"The problem was `FindNode` was performing a linear scan, so the lookup became $$O(N²)$$. It is now $$O(1)$$.\r\n\r\nThe following table shows the total CPU time (in seconds) of the `reflect_spirv` function:\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| :---- | :---- |\r\n| <img width=\"2808\" height=\"1800\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-28 at 14 40 28@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/734a0d05-aaf8-4225-af05-ce3fbdfab60c\" /> | <img width=\"2804\" height=\"1810\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-28 at 14 40 53@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bcf75dc-6adb-4fc8-925e-b681caa672c4\" /> |\r\n\r\n **TL;DR**\r\n\r\n7.24 s down to 544 ms and improves _all_ platforms.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> We should submit a patch to https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Reflect\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>🤖 AI Disclosure</summary>\r\n\r\nI worked with AI to identify the root cause and used it to help write a solution. I benchmarked and fed the data to the agent. I understand the code and the changes and have validated it.\r\n\r\n</details>","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https